{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"& \\\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Git\\\\bin\\\\bash.exe\\\" -c \\\"cd /d/tmp/rsi-tf0604-run5/trials/tf-0294-a02-baseline-2/agent && cat harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a01-isolation-pilot-reverify.md\\\"\"","aggregated_output":"---\nlifecycleStatus: completed\nid: harness-gap-a01-isolation-pilot-reverify\ntitle: 复验 A1 隔离执行受控 pilot 门（A01）\nscenario: gateway-backend-communication\ntaskType: runtime-bridge\nintent: A01 按原 spec 门限复验 A1 Layered Execution Isolation 的受控 pilot 门：逐条把 4 个毕业判据映射到当前候选的可执行证据；不重定义门限；记录 spec requiredTests 缺口修正（计数器测试原缺）与残余。\ntouchedAreas:\n  - harness/specs/tasks/a1-layered-isolation-pilot.md\n  - tests/unit/a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts\n  - harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a01-isolation-pilot-reverify.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a01-a1-isolation-gate.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a01-acceptance.json\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/A01-SHA256SUMS\nownedPaths:\n  - harness/specs/tasks/a1-layered-isolation-pilot.md\n  - tests/unit/a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts\n  - harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a01-isolation-pilot-reverify.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a01-a1-isolation-gate.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a01-acceptance.json\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/A01-SHA256SUMS\nrequiredProfiles:\n  - fast\n  - comms\nrequiredRules:\n  - backend-communication-boundary\n  - comms-regression\n  - docs-sync\n  - task-forest-autoclose-and-roles\n  - repository-artifact-retention\nhumanEvidence: not-required\nrequiredTests:\n  - tests/unit/tool-registration.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/policy-light-snapshotter.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/shadow-write-event-recorder.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/trace-namespace-enforcement.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts\nacceptance:\n  - 判据1 legacy fallback rate < 5%：deprecation-counters 单测断言 >5% → violated、<=5% → not violated（数值门限未改）。\n  - 判据2 p99 ≤ 200ms：performance-budgets 断言 p99 预算。\n  - 判据3 declaredPathViolationCount 单独计数并被跟踪。\n  - 判据4 checkBudgetViolation('a1') 在 rate>5% 时返回 action=degrade_to_legacy。\n  - 工具 writeRiskProfile 声明与命名空间拒绝（claw.a4.tool.choice on a1）由 tool-registration / trace-namespace-enforcement 覆盖。\n  - 发现并修正 spec drift：a1 spec 的 requiredTests 原缺计数器测试；已补入并加 coverage 守卫，原门限字节不变。\n  - 干净候选定向测试、类型、scoped lint、harness validate/dry-run、comms replay/compare 通过，凭据扫描 0 命中，SHA256SUMS 可回读。\nexpectedUserBehavior:\n  - 维护者能从当前候选复核 A1 毕业门，逐条看到判据与证据；门限未被重定义；spec requiredTests 与证据同步。\ndocs:\n  required: true\n  files:\n    - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a01-a1-isolation-gate.md\n---\n\n# A01 冻结实施边界\n\nA01 不实现新功能，只复验既有 A1 pilot 门并修正 spec drift。门限取自原 `a1-layered-isolation-pilot.md`（fallback <5%、p99 ≤200ms、declaredPathViolationCount 趋势、degrade_to_legacy），**不重定义**。修正点：原 spec 的 `requiredTests` 漏了覆盖判据1/3/4 的计数器测试；补入 `tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts` 与 `openclaw_runtime/src/observability/deprecation-counters.test.ts`，并加 `tests/unit/a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts` 守卫。\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"& \\\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Git\\\\bin\\\\bash.exe\\\" -c \\\"cd /d/tmp/rsi-tf0604-run5/trials/tf-0294-a02-baseline-2/agent && cat docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a01-a1-isolation-gate.md; echo '=====ACCEPTANCE====='; cat docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a01-acceptance.json; echo '=====SHA====='; cat docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/A01-SHA256SUMS\\\"\"","aggregated_output":"# A01：复验 A1 隔离执行受控 pilot 门\n\n日期：2026-10-13（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：A01（TF-0293）。真实 provider 调用：无。\n\n## 判据 → 证据映射（原门限，不改）\n\n| 判据 | 证据 | 结果 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1. legacy fallback rate < 5%（100 轮） | `tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts`：>5% → violated；≤5% → not violated | PASS |\n| 2. p99 ≤ 200ms | `tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts`（p99 预算） | PASS |\n| 3. declaredPathViolationCount 单独计数/跟踪 | `deprecation-counters` + 上表测试 | PASS |\n| 4. `checkBudgetViolation('a1')` → `degrade_to_legacy` | 上表测试断言 `action === 'degrade_to_legacy'` | PASS |\n| 工具 `writeRiskProfile` + registry 强制 | `tests/unit/tool-registration.test.ts` 等（writeRiskProfile 出现在 3 个测试） | PASS |\n| 命名空间拒绝（`claw.a4.tool.choice` on a1） | `tests/unit/trace-namespace-enforcement.test.ts` | PASS |\n\n## 实跑\n\n- 原 spec requiredTests 5 files / **64 passed**。\n- 计数器测试 `tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts` **19 passed**；`openclaw_runtime/src/observability/deprecation-counters.test.ts` **3 passed**。\n- 新增覆盖守卫 `tests/unit/a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts` **3 passed**。\n\n## 修正的 spec drift（HG25）\n\n原 `a1-layered-isolation-pilot.md` 的 `requiredTests` 只列了 5 个测试，**没有**覆盖判据1/3/4 的 `deprecation-counters` 测试 —— 即 \"Active Pilot Gate\" 曾是标题而非可复核状态。已把两个计数器测试补进 `requiredTests`，门限文本未改；`a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts` 断言该接线存在，防止再次漂移。\n\n## 残余（residual）\n\n- 复验为确定性本地证据（非真实 provider/真人）；门限仍按原 spec。\n- 不改产品默认/锁/approval；A1 仍是 pilot（非 default-on/GA）。\n=====ACCEPTANCE=====\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"asOf\": \"2026-10-13\",\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n  \"actor\": \"codex-a01-mainline-developer\",\n  \"driven_by\": \"agent\",\n  \"scope\": {\n    \"task\": \"TF-0293\",\n    \"packet\": \"A01\",\n    \"title\": \"Re-verify A1 layered-isolation controlled pilot gate\",\n    \"source\": \"current-candidate unit tests (no live provider)\",\n    \"liveProvider\": false,\n    \"realHuman\": false\n  },\n  \"decision\": {\n    \"status\": \"PASS\",\n    \"evidenceTier\": \"clean-candidate-local-automated-acceptance\",\n    \"reason\": \"Every A1 graduation criterion maps to a current executable assertion at the ORIGINAL thresholds (fallback <5%, p99<=200ms, declaredPathViolationCount tracked, degrade_to_legacy). A spec requiredTests drift was fixed: the counter tests were missing from the A1 spec and are now wired with a coverage guard.\"\n  },\n  \"candidate\": {\n    \"commit\": \"46e553fd87d5fadf14d6f7aa7a7a85b614aef466\",\n    \"tree\": \"3d2e7f7e5e7d6b071405ee24be65fb0e07db9849\",\n    \"dirty\": false,\n    \"branch\": \"codex/harness-gap-a01-isolation-reverify-20261013\",\n    \"base\": \"72ba3c32e31cf071aa98c3ed335f76d9b12ef1c1\",\n    \"workspace\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\27933\\\\.codex\\\\worktrees\\\\o02-main\\\\ClawX\",\n    \"startedAt\": \"2026-10-13T15:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"finishedAt\": \"2026-10-13T15:12:00.000Z\"\n  },\n  \"criteria\": {\n    \"criterion1_fallbackRate\": {\n      \"threshold\": \"legacyFallbackCount/(legacyFallbackCount+shadowSuccessCount) < 0.05 over 100 turns\",\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts (>5% -> violated; <=5% -> not violated)\",\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\n    },\n    \"criterion2_p99\": {\n      \"threshold\": \"p99 <= 200ms\",\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts\",\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\n    },\n    \"criterion3_declaredPath\": {\n      \"threshold\": \"declaredPathViolationCount tracked / decreasing trend over 3 sessions\",\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/unit/deprecation